<section class="section" data-panel="reviews">
        <p class="status review-operation-status" id="reviewStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="review-workspace-grid">
          <aside class="panel review-browser">
            <div class="panel-head">
              <div><h2>客户评价</h2><span id="reviewSystemStatus">管理客户反馈，修改后保存草稿并审核。</span></div>
              <button class="button" id="newReviewButton" type="button">新增评价</button>
            </div>
            <div class="toolbar is-row">
              <label>查找评价<input id="reviewSearch" type="search" placeholder="评价人或评价内容" /></label>
              <label>显示状态<select id="reviewVisibilityFilter"><option value="">全部</option><option value="shown">设为显示</option><option value="hidden">设为隐藏</option></select></label>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reviewRefreshButton" type="button">更新列表</button>
              <button class="button secondary" id="reviewDraftsButton" type="button">草稿 <span id="reviewDraftCount">0</span></button>
              <span class="status" id="reviewListStatus">评价列表未加载。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="blog-list" id="reviewList"></div>
          </aside>
          <section class="panel review-editor-panel">
            <div id="reviewEditorEmpty" class="review-editor-empty"><strong>选择一条评价开始编辑</strong><p>也可以点击“新增评价”，填写客户反馈。</p></div>
            <div id="reviewEditorView" hidden>
            <div class="panel-head"><div><h2 id="reviewEditorTitle">编辑客户评价</h2><span>保存草稿后，在下方草稿列表审核。</span></div><button class="button secondary" id="reviewBackButton" type="button">返回评价列表</button></div>
            <form class="form" id="reviewForm">
              <input id="reviewId" type="hidden" />
              <div class="field"><label for="reviewBuyerLabel">评价人</label><input id="reviewBuyerLabel" required /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="reviewRating">星级</label><select id="reviewRating"><option value="5">5 星</option><option value="4">4 星</option><option value="3">3 星</option><option value="2">2 星</option><option value="1">1 星</option></select></div>
              <div class="field is-wide"><label for="reviewQuote">评价原文</label><textarea id="reviewQuote" rows="6" required></textarea></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="reviewDate">评价日期（选填）</label><input id="reviewDate" type="date" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label>审核后的显示状态</label><label class="toggle"><input id="reviewPublished" type="checkbox" checked /><span>显示这条评价</span></label></div>
            </form>
            <div class="review-edit-preview" aria-label="编辑内容预览"><span class="field-help">编辑预览</span><strong id="reviewPreviewBuyer"></strong><span id="reviewPreviewRating"></span><blockquote id="reviewPreviewQuote"></blockquote><small id="reviewPreviewDate"></small></div>
            <div class="actions editor-save-bar">
              <button class="button" id="saveReviewDraftButton" type="button">保存草稿</button>
              <button class="button danger" id="deleteReviewDraftButton" disabled type="button">删除这条评价</button>
              <a class="button secondary" href="#reviewDraftWorkspace">查看草稿</a>
            </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
        <section class="panel review-draft-workspace" id="reviewDraftWorkspace"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>评价草稿</h2><p>评价修改在此审核；标记“删除评价”的草稿审核通过后，才会移除正式评价。</p></div></div><div class="drafts" id="reviewDraftList"></div></section>
      </section>
